  "findings": [
    "FIP main uses five frame x0..x4, masked central observations during pretraining, increasing added noise, intermediate/final supervision, then unmasked denoising and optional transition epoch.",
    "LVD supplied flags pe10/pf16; scales neighbor residual by1/g and central residual byg, restores ordinary task afterward; noise maps also scaled in DenBlock.",
    "LVD raw residual assumes comparable observation/GT photometry; applying identical input-minus-brightGT arithmetic to low-light RGB also changes the conditional mean.",
    "FIP uses future2; LVD forward uses past/current/future1 and supplied configuration may invoke coarse SpyNet; not inference-history-free single-frame or causal0-future copies."
